<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 14/15.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 14/15.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Monday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for July 15. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   15.07.97	  14.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.7560	    6.7588</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.2498	    2.2800</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.4358	    4.4854</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5256	    3.5140</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5152	    0.5183</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7595	    0.7671</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2811	    0.2850</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9979	    7.0194</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6926	    0.6923</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1947	    1.2078</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
